   "opacity": 1,
   "isLocked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "textRegions": [
    {
     "characters": "You\u2019ve always been a light in my life, kind, funny, and endlessly inspiring. I hope your day is filled with love, laughter, and all your favorite things.\n \u2013 Dad ",
